Third-party assets bundled with this project
=============================================

Tile face SVGs — web/static/tiles/
-----------------------------------
Source:  FluffyStuff/riichi-mahjong-tiles
         https://github.com/FluffyStuff/riichi-mahjong-tiles
License: Public domain (CC0 1.0 Universal), per the source repository's README.

Vendored: the 34 playable-tile faces ("Regular" style: Man1-9, Pin1-9, Sou1-9, Ton, Nan, Shaa,
Pei, Chun, Hatsu, Haku) and the tile back (Back.svg). The source repo's red-five ("-Dora")
variants and its Black/Export style variants were not vendored — not needed by this ruleset.

Not covered: this project's flower/season tiles (8 additional faces required by Hong Kong
mahjong, docs/01-rules-spec.md §1) have no equivalent art in the FluffyStuff set, which covers
only the 34 riichi tile types. That art still needs to be sourced separately — see
docs/03-frontend.md §7.
